        "line": 1,
        "display": "from cuprum.adapters import pump_metrics",
        "doc": {
          "summary": "Metrics adapter for Rust-pump routing events.",
          "body": [
            "Counts the pump lifecycle facts that are otherwise visible only as <code>DEBUG</code> log records: how often an inter-stage hop declined the Rust pump, broken down by the seam that refused; how often a cancelled hop's worker failed; and how long native cleanup took after cancellation.",
